<title>UK: Freighter leaves Honolulu for China after repairs.</title>
<headline>Freighter leaves Honolulu for China after repairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The St Vincent-flag freighter Prudent Challenger, 14,930 dwt, has left Honolulu for China with a cargo of fishmeal after engine repairs, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence said on Friday.</p>
</text>
